---
import Tunnel from '../../../layouts/Tunnel.astro';
import Choice from '../../../components/Choice.astro';
---
<Tunnel title="Step 2 - Prepare the USB | Save My Gig!" status="Critical · Recovery" red>
  <div class="step-label">Step 2 of 5</div>
  <h2 style="margin-bottom:1rem">Prepare the USB</h2>

  <p>Your files are now temporarily safe on this computer.</p>

  <div class="alert-card" style="margin-bottom:1.5rem">
    <div style="font-size:20px">⚠️</div>
    <div><strong>The next step will ERASE your USB.</strong> This is irreversible. Only the tracks you copied to the computer will remain.</div>
  </div>

  <p>You are about to format the USB so it can be read again by CDJs.</p>

  <p class="question">Are you ready to erase the USB and continue?</p>

  <Choice step="erase_consent"
    a={{ href: '/protocol/critical/format', label: 'YES - ERASE AND CONTINUE' }}
    b={{ href: '/protocol/critical/no-erase', label: 'NO - STOP HERE' }}
  />
</Tunnel>
